        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The production of an optical mouse includes the sheet rolling of the steel plate plus the injection moulding of the plastic and rubber parts (cover, base and wheel).\n\n# Included processes\nThe wireless mouse is modeled using the existing wired mouse dataset. The modifications to the existing mice include the addition of a single NiMh battery (25 grams), the removal of wired cable, and lastly the increased mass of PCB components (Babbitt et al., 2020). The rest of other inventory flows are assumed to be the same as optimized wired mice - see the mentioned dataset.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
